# Editor and tooling settings for working on this repository.
.vscode/**
.vscode-test/**
.claude/**
.entire/**
.github/**

# The MCP server entries Entirely itself writes into a project it is used in.
.mcp.json

# Build inputs and output. The package carries the bundle in dist/ and
# nothing else the build produced.
out/**
node_modules/**
src/**
scripts/**
esbuild.js
**/tsconfig.json
**/eslint.config.mjs
**/*.map
**/*.ts
**/.vscode-test.*
test-workspace/**

# Documentation. The README links to these and the packager rewrites the
# links to the repository, so the files themselves are not shipped. The
# documentation site is a separate project with its own toolchain.
docs/**
site/**

# The README screenshots and logo are read from the repository by the
# marketplace page. The package carries only the extension icon, the
# activity bar icon and the detail panel icon (images/logo.png,
# images/codicon-robot.svg, images/entirely-view.svg).
images/hero.png
images/sessions.png
images/output.png

# The vendored brand symbol is only the source of images/entirely-view.svg;
# the package carries the icon, not the artwork it was built from.
assets/brand/**

# Local scratch: research notes, source artwork and the scratch copy of the
# repository used to drive the editor while taking the screenshots.
.local/**

# Local planning artifacts. They are not part of the published package.
AGENTS.md
BUDGET.md
IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md
PROGRESS.md
RUN_LOG.md
features.json
plan.toml
capabilities/**
tasks/**

# Packages built earlier, and the repository's own ignore file.
*.vsix
.gitignore
